# CHANGES

Reverse chronological summary of every commit in this repository.

Unreleased
----------
- Add Mass Compile dialog for queued demo compile/assemble/run jobs with selectable per-job logs, background execution, queued source drafts, per-job scratch edits, waiting-on-dirty-save behavior, and cooperative compile-time yielding for a responsive UI.
- Add PL/EDIT, an optional hotkey-driven source editor mode with F4/Ctrl-Space template expansion, Tab/Enter field navigation, help, and fullscreen editing.
- Add branch-printing demos, an empty default module, and a multi-file project skeleton using .msw include units for DCLs, PROCs, and MACRODEFs.
- Add this CHANGES file and link it from the application footer.
- Update README, design, architecture, and product requirements docs for PL/EDIT and the expanded demo set.
- Add a Format button for PL/SW-style indentation and a generated favicon.

